{"step_index":414,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-01T03:36:00Z","thinking":"**Interpreting User's Focused Request**\n\nThe user's request, \"법인번호만 바라,\" means extracting and focusing *solely* on the \"사업자번호\" (BizNo) column from a dataset. The dataset appears to contain company information with BizNo being the target field, disregarding other columns. The focus is to retrieve this specific piece of information from each of the provided rows starting from 702.\n\n\n**Validating Corporate Registration Numbers**\n\nNeed to thoroughly examine the corporate registration number (법인번호) in the dataset, specifically focusing on column 11. Initially, it requires validating the format to ensure it conforms to the standard 13-digit format, which can be either with or without a hyphen. Furthermore, apply a Modulus 11 check-digit verification based on the Korean corporate registration number algorithm.\n\nCritical analysis will include matching the entity type based on the registration number's central digits (codes) against company name conventions. This includes checking for mismatches between company types (e.g., 법인 vs 개인사업자). Key inspection point will be to flag empty values where company names include legal identifiers.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"node -e \"\nconst fs = require('fs');\nconst lines = fs.readFileSync('user_pasted_rows.tsv', 'utf-8').split('\\n').filter(l => l.trim().length > 0);\n\n// Korean Corporate Registration Number Check-digit algorithm\nfunction isValidCorpNoCheckDigit(corpNo) {\n  const clean = corpNo.replace(/[^0-9]/g, '');\n  if (clean.length !== 13) return false;\n  const weights = [1, 2, 1, 2, 1, 2, 1, 2, 1, 2, 1, 2];\n  let sum = 0;\n  for (let i = 0; i < 12; i++) {\n    sum += Number(clean[i]) * weights[i];\n  }\n  const remainder = sum % 10;\n  const checkDigit = (10 - remainder) % 10;\n  return Number(clean[12]) === checkDigit;\n}\n\n// Business Registration Number middle code\nfunction getBizType(bizno) {\n  const clean = bizno.replace(/[^0-9]/g, '');\n  if (clean.length !== 10) return 'UNKNOWN';\n  const mid = clean.substring(3, 5);\n  const midNum = Number(mid);\n  if ((midNum >= 1 && midNum <= 79) || (midNum >= 90 && midNum <= 99)) return '개인사업자';\n  if (['81', '86', '87', '88'].includes(mid)) return '영리법인본점';\n  if (mid === '85') return '영리법인지점';\n  if (mid === '82') return '비영리법인';\n  if (mid === '83') return '국가/지자체/공공기관';\n  if (mid === '84') return '외국법인';\n  if (mid === '80') return '법인아닌단체(동창회/입대위등)';\n  return '기타';\n}\n\nconst header = lines[0].split('\\t');\nconsole.log('Header columns:', header);\n\nlet total = 0;\nlet corpNoPresent = 0;\nlet corpNoMissing = 0;\nlet checkDigitValid = 0;\nlet checkDigitInvalid = [];\nlet formatInvalid = [];\nlet individualWithCorpNo = [];\nlet corpWithoutCorpNo = [];\n\n// Skip header\nlet startIdx = 0;\nfor (let i = 0; i < lines.length; i++) {\n  if (lines[i].includes('와우미디어')) {\n    startIdx = i;\n    break;\n  }\n}\n\nconsole.log('Data starts at line index:', startIdx);\n\nfor (let i = startIdx; i < lines.length; i++) {\n  const rowNum = 702 + (i - startIdx);\n  const p = lines[i].split('\\t');\n  if (p.length < 5) continue;\n  total++;\n  \n  const company = (p[0] || '').trim();\n  const bizno = (p[1] || '').trim();\n  const corpNo = (p[11] || '').trim();\n  const bizType = getBizType(bizno);\n  \n  if (corpNo) {\n    corpNoPresent++;\n    const cleanCorpNo = corpNo.replace(/[^0-9]/g, '');\n    \n    // Check format\n    if (cleanCorpNo.length !== 13) {\n      formatInvalid.push({ rowNum, company, bizno, corpNo, reason: '13자리 아님 (' + cleanCorpNo.length + '자리)' });\n    } else {\n      // Check check-digit\n      if (isValidCorpNoCheckDigit(cleanCorpNo)) {\n        checkDigitValid++;\n      } else {\n        checkDigitInvalid.push({ rowNum, company, bizno, corpNo });\n      }\n    }\n    \n    // Check if individual business has corpNo\n    if (bizType === '개인사업자' && !company.includes('(주)') && !company.includes('주식회사') && !company.includes('유한회사')) {\n      individualWithCorpNo.push({ rowNum, company, bizno, corpNo, bizType });\n    }\n  } else {\n    corpNoMissing++;\n    // Check if corporation is missing corpNo\n    if (['영리법인본점', '영리법인지점', '비영리법인'].includes(bizType) || company.includes('(주)') || company.includes('주식회사') || company.includes('유한회사') || company.includes('(사)') || company.includes('(재)')) {\n      corpWithoutCorpNo.push({ rowNum, company, bizno, bizType });\n    }\n  }\n}\n\nconsole.log('=== 법인번호 감사 결과 요약 ===');\nconsole.log('총 분석 기업 수:', total);\nconsole.log('법인번호 기재 건수:', corpNoPresent);\nconsole.log('법인번호 미기재(빈값):', corpNoMissing);\nconsole.log('체크섬(Check-digit) 일치 유효 번호:', checkDigitValid);\nconsole.log('형식 오류(13자리 아님):', formatInvalid.length);\nconsole.log('체크섬 불일치 의심 번호:', checkDigitInvalid.length);\nconsole.log('법인인데 법인번호 누락:', corpWithoutCorpNo.length);\nconsole.log('개인사업자인데 법인번호 기재:', individualWithCorpNo.length);\n\nif (formatInvalid.length > 0) console.log('\\\\n[형식 오류 상세]:', formatInvalid.slice(0, 10));\nif (checkDigitInvalid.length > 0) console.log('\\\\n[체크섬 오류 상세]:', checkDigitInvalid.slice(0, 10));\nif (corpWithoutCorpNo.length > 0) console.log('\\\\n[법인번호 누락 법인 상세 (상위 15건)]:', corpWithoutCorpNo.slice(0, 15));\nif (individualWithCorpNo.length > 0) console.log('\\\\n[개인사업자에 법인번호 기재 상세]:', individualWithCorpNo.slice(0, 10));\n\"","Cwd":"c:\\Users\\lg\\resilient-bardeen","WaitMsBeforeAsync":3000,"toolAction":"Auditing corporate numbers","toolSummary":"Audit corporate registration numbers"}}]}
